 "remarks": "This top-floor sanctuary at Mallards Landing offers bright, airy living perfectly situated on the Darien/Norwalk line. Step inside to an inviting open floor plan framed by vaulted ceilings, skylights, and a wood-burning fireplace in the living room, which opens directly to a large private deck with serene wooded views. The updated kitchen features sleek granite countertops, a breakfast bar, and a full suite of stainless steel appliances-including a range, microwave, and dishwasher-flowing effortlessly into a spacious dining area. Both full bathrooms and bedrooms are filled with natural light, highlighted by a primary suite complete with an oversized closet and an en-suite bath. Thoughtful extras include an entryway with two spacious closets, in-unit washer and dryer, attic storage, and an additional storage unit on the property. Residents enjoy two reserved parking spaces and access to the community pool and pool house, all just minutes from I-95, public transportation, and local shopping.",
